# Always commit and push

When a task produces code or config changes, finish by committing and pushing without waiting to be asked again.

- Commit with a short why-focused message.
- Push `main` to `origin` (`https://github.com/emtfull/blackjack-prediction-lab`).
- Also push the same work to `https://github.com/emtfull/e-blackjack` `main` when the official table / player / multiplayer work changed.
- Do not skip hooks or force-push unless the user explicitly asks.
